OL,3,GNEWSALooking inside 'stunning' historic
OL,4,Acourt building
OL,5,
OL,6,FLead paint, asbestos and other dangers
OL,7,Fare being removed from a historic court
OL,8,Fbuilding left empty since the 1980s -
OL,9,Fin the first stages of its
OL,10,Ftransformation into a museum.
OL,12,FThe Assize Court in Devizes is a grand,
OL,13,Flisted building created in 1835 but
OL,14,Fabandoned with no other approved use
OL,15,Ffor it until now.
OL,17,FWiltshire Museum, currently at Long
OL,18,FStreet in the town, intends to relocate
OL,19,Fthere and open it in 2030, but a lot of
OL,20,Fwork needs to be done before that.
